   "at": 1791461939741,
   "type": "diagnosis",
   "diagnosis": {
    "service": "shop",
    "root_cause": "Commit 8c7a09c ('sort variables and unify internal URLs') introduced a typo in config/shop.env, changing INVENTORY_URL from http://inventory:8000 to http://inventroy:8000. The shop service can no longer resolve the inventory host, so every call to inventory fails and shop returns 502s.",
    "culprit_commit": "8c7a09c",
    "evidence": [
     "Shop logs show 343 'upstream unavailable' errors with target=inventory and error 'Temporary failure in name resolution', starting at 12:17:32 (NEW, 0 in the hour before).",
     "The commit was merged at 12:15:58 and auto-deployed, which matches the alert start of 12:17:31.",
     "The diff of 8c7a09c changes INVENTORY_URL=http://inventory:8000 to http://inventroy:8000 (a typo). The current config/shop.env still contains the misspelt value.",
     "Metrics show shop->inventory status=error at 5.38/s now, against 0 before, while 200/201 responses from inventory dropped to 0.",
     "GET /products returns 502 in about 4ms, consistent with an immediate DNS failure rather than a timeout.",
     "Users and payments 5xx rates are normal, so those services are not the origin."
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "plan": [
     "Revert commit 8c7a09c, or fix INVENTORY_URL to http://inventory:8000 in config/shop.env, and let the auto-deploy roll it out.",
     "Verify there are no more 'name resolution' errors in the shop logs.",
     "Verify that shop->inventory status=200/201 upstream requests recover and the shop 5xx rate returns to baseline (about 0.04).",
     "Consider adding a config validation or startup check that resolves upstream hosts before deploy."
    ],
    "action": {
     "kind": "rollback",
     "target": "8c7a09c",
     "reason": "Reverting the commit restores the correct INVENTORY_URL hostname, so shop can resolve and reach inventory again.",
     "evidence": [
      "8c7a09c changed INVENTORY_URL to the misspelt host 'inventroy'.",
      "Shop logs show DNS resolution failures for target=inventory only since 12:17:32.",
      "Shop 5xx rate is up ×9.45 and shop->inventory calls are all failing."
     ],
     "requires_approval": true
    }
